OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot by police detained under
OL,4,AMental Health Act
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s who was shot three
OL,7,Ftimes by police officers has been
OL,8,Fdetained under the Mental Health Act.
OL,10,FThe man was shot and seriously injured
OL,11,Fby armed officers who responded to
OL,12,Freports of a suspected firearm on
OL,13,FFishponds Road in Eastville, Bristol,
OL,14,Fon 22 October.
OL,16,FAfter trying to gain entry to the
OL,17,Fproperty and seeing a man holding what
OL,18,Fappeared to be weapons, the officers
OL,19,Fshot three times at the man, who
OL,20,Fsustained a serious injury to his
OL,21,Fchest.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
