OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot by police detained under
OL,4,AMental Health Act
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was taken to hospital by ambulance
OL,7,Fwhere he underwent emergency surgery.
OL,8,FHe has now been detained under the
OL,9,FMental Health Act, police said.
